---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
import { getPosts } from '../data/posts';
const posts = (await getPosts()).slice(0, 3);
---
<Base>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-main">
      <p class="hello">你好，我是 Chris Wang</p>
      <h1>在网络与书页之间，<br />连接值得探索的世界。</h1>
      <p class="hero-role">Consulting Engineering Technical Leader at Cisco,<br class="desktop-break" /> focused on data center and enterprise networking.</p>
      <p class="hero-personal">工作之外，喜欢读书、徒步，也动手做一些让阅读更有意思的小项目。</p>
      <div class="hero-links"><a class="button" href="#projects">看看我的项目 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="quiet-link" href="/about/">更多关于我</a></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-note" aria-label="兴趣与探索">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 230 180" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 134c40 0 32-88 78-88s26 99 70 99c20 0 26-27 50-27" stroke="#86a8b9" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 7"/><path d="m23 136 36-45 21 25 34-59 47 78 25-35 31 35" stroke="#54796b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="159" cy="38" r="13" stroke="#a9955f" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M36 156h158" stroke="#b2c0b8"/></svg>
      <p>保持好奇，<br />总有新的路径。</p>
      <span>Networks, books & trails.</span>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="projects-section wrap" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="projects-heading">把兴趣，做成可以分享的东西。</h2><p>目前在做的两个阅读项目</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">全部项目 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="project-grid">{projects.map(project => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="writing-section wrap" aria-labelledby="writing-heading">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="writing-heading">写下来，慢慢想。</h2><p>关于技术、阅读，以及路上的见闻</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">全部文字 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <PostList posts={posts} />
  </section>
  <section class="closing-note wrap"><span class="note-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>从一个问题出发，<br class="mobile-break" />去一本书里、去一条路上，找找答案。</p><a href="/rss.xml">通过 RSS 订阅文字 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</Base>
